  <h1>Legal, privacy, and photography policy</h1>
  <h2>Age verification</h2>
  <p>This site and the resorts it describes are restricted to guests 21 years of age or older. By continuing past the age verification screen, you confirm you meet this requirement. We do not knowingly collect information from or market to anyone under 21.</p>
  <h2>Photography and recording policy</h2>
  <p>Photos and video are only ever okay with the clear consent of everyone who would appear in them. In practice, that almost always means keeping the camera to the privacy of your own room, since a genuine yes from everyone nearby at a pool, lounge, or theme night is rarely realistic to get. Recording anyone without their consent is not permitted anywhere on property.</p>
  <p>This policy is enforced by on-site staff and applies to every guest, regardless of comfort level or activity. Violations may result in removal from the resort without refund, at the resort's discretion.</p>
  <h2>Guest privacy</h2>
  <p>What happens on-property stays between consenting guests. We do not publish, share, or request guest photos or identifying details from clothing-optional or adults-only spaces, and we expect the same discretion from every guest.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
  <p>This site may earn a commission when you book through links or widgets found here. This does not affect the price you pay, and our recommendations reflect our own editorial judgment.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy, or a concern about a specific incident, can be directed to {{ site.email }}.</p>
  <p class="legal-entity-note">This site is operated by {{ site.legalEntity }}.</p>
</article>

