  <h2>Form Security &amp; Cloudflare Turnstile</h2>
  <p>To protect our inquiry forms and maintain site security against automated spam, credential abuse, and malicious bot activity, we use <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>, operated by Cloudflare, Inc.</p>
  <p>Turnstile evaluates technical, non-identifying telemetry signals from your browser and device session (such as IP address, User-Agent string, TLS/cryptographic browser fingerprint, and challenge response interaction metrics) to verify that submissions originate from human visitors. This data is processed strictly for security validation and bot prevention under our legitimate business interests, and is never used to profile, track, or target individuals across third-party websites.</p>
  <p>For additional details regarding Cloudflare's data collection and privacy protections, please consult the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Turnstile Privacy Notice</a> and the general <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
